212, "text": "So sing along with me, or rather, sing against,"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "We don\u2019t care about perfect, it\u2019s the joy that makes sense."}, {"beat": 228, "text": "Music is a party, a joyful endless spree,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "And I\u2019m the artist who sings off-key but brings glee."}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}